        "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued September 2 at 5:00AM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...A warm front associated with strong Bering Sea low will\nmove in Wednesday afternoon into Wednesday evening, with\nmoderate to heavy rain and gusty winds expected through\nThursday. Rainfall totals are expected to be around 1 to 1.50\ninches, with wind gusts up to 55 mph out of the east/southeast.\n\n* WHERE...St. Lawrence Island.\n\n* WHEN...Wednesday September 2 through Thursday September 3.\n\n* IMPACTS...Heavy rain and gusty winds could make travel difficult\nat times.",
        "severity": "Moderate",
        "certainty": "Observed",
        "urgency": "Expected",
